   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dark Star v1**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Drumz & Drone**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2023-07-07.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 185 min [1]\n- **deadco2023-07-07.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac16**: source not stated; 19 songs; 185 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper placed the rig beside the right side of the mixer enclosure, front corner, on a large stand at 13 feet [1]\n- Lineup listed: Mickey Hart, Bob Weir, Oteil Burbridge, Jeff Chimenti, Jay Lane and John Mayer [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2023-07-07.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac24**: taped by Steve Weld; transferred by Steve Weld; source: Neumann SKM 140(AK40's/LC3's/KM100's)>HQRP xlr>Aeta PSP3>xlr-1/8\" mini>Sony PCM-M10 @24bit/96kHz [1]. Also: Recorded with Neumann SKM 140 microphones into an Aeta PSP3 preamp and a Sony PCM-M10 recorder at 24-bit/96kHz [1]\n- **deadco2023-07-07.neumann_skm140.sunboy.flac16**: taped by Steve Weld; transferred by Steve Weld; source: Neumann SKM 140(AK40's/LC3's/KM100's)>HQRP xlr>Aeta PSP3>xlr-1/8\" mini>Sony PCM-M10 @24bit/96kHz [2]",
